i</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Calzetti</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Bertagnin</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Luster</surname><given-names>AD</given-names></name><name><surname>McDonald</surname><given-names>PP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Regulated production of the interferon-gamma-inducible protein-10 (IP-10) chemokine by human neutrophils</article-title><source>Eur J Immunol</source><year>1997</year><volume>27</volume><fpage>111</fpage><lpage>5</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9022006</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/eji.1830270117</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Olsen</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Wiker</surname><given-names>HG</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Langeggen</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Reitan</surname><given-names>LJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Elevated antibody responses in patients with Crohn's disease against a 14-kDa secreted protein purified from <italic>Mycobacterium avium </italic>subsp. <italic>paratuberculosis</italic></article-title><source>Scan J Immunol</source><year>2001</year><volume>53</volume><fpage>198</fpage><lpage>203</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1046/j.1365-3083.2001.00857.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>El-Zaatari</surname><given-names>FA</given-names></name><name><surname>Naser</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name><name><surname>Hulten</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Burch</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Graham</surname><given-names>DY</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Characterization o